The '''{{PAGENAME}}''' is a steam train that the [[Huntik Foundation|Huntik]] team used to go to a [[Southern Romania Train Station|train station]] on the way to the [[Castle of Vlad Dracul]]. On the way, the train was attacked by [[Klaus|Klaus']] [[Suits]]. {{source|The Vampire Loses Its Fangs}}

The train was later used again by [[Lok Lambert]], [[Den Fears]] and [[Sophie Casterwill]] to return to the Vlad's Castle and contain the wild [[Titan]] [[Antedeluvian]]. {{source|Lok's Leadership}}

